OL,3,GNEWSANational League club 'loving
OL,4,Alimelight' ahead of FA Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league football club is gearing
OL,7,Fup for one of the biggest days in its
OL,8,Fhistory as it prepares to host 2021
OL,9,Fwinners Leicester City in the first
OL,10,Fround of the FA Cup.
OL,12,FOxford City will welcome the foxes to
OL,13,Fthe MGroup Stadium at Court Place Farm
OL,14,Fin the hopes of adding to the list of
OL,15,Fgreat FA Cup upsets on Friday night.
OL,17,FThe Hoops currently sit second in
OL,18,FNational League North, with their
OL,19,Fopponents 10th in League One - a whole
OL,20,F64 places higher in the English
OL,21,Ffootball pyramid.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
